// Grounded Brain: layered design (routes → controllers → services → repositories)
// Eraser "Flow Chart" diagram-as-code
title Layered design
direction right
colorMode bold

Routes [icon: git-branch, color: gray, label: "routes\nURL + middleware"]
Controller [icon: check-square, color: green, label: "controller\nvalidate (Zod) + respond"]
Service [icon: settings, color: green, label: "service\nrules + orchestration"]
Repository [icon: layers, color: blue, label: "repository\nqueries"]
Data stores [shape: cylinder, icon: database, color: blue, label: "Postgres / Pinecone / Mem0"]
External APIs [icon: globe, color: orange, label: "OpenAI · Firecrawl · Tavily · Cloudinary"]
EventPublisher [icon: zap, color: purple, label: "EventPublisher → Inngest"]

Routes > Controller > Service > Repository > Data stores
Service > External APIs
Service > EventPublisher
